{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2383960/extras/0b3ff33ac521f265089d0ae2ca062bbc.poster.avif?t=1757300090\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2383960/extras/0b3ff33ac521f265089d0ae2ca062bbc.webm?t=1757300090\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2383960/extras/0b3ff33ac521f265089d0ae2ca062bbc.mp4?t=1757300090\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2383960/extras/c501dc399294dec78cd457e3cfe892df.avif?t=1757300090\" width=600 height=100 /></span>Manipulate a swarm of insect minions in fast-paced, team-based battles. Coordinate with fellow fungi to outwit opponents and fight for a taste of victory! Inspired by arcade hits like <i>Killer Queen</i>, <i>Shroom Siege</i> offers\u00a0 easy-to-learn gameplay mechanics and Japanese-inspired ink-wash designs, providing depth and complexity for seasoned shrooms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2383960/extras/f17d49f2d458e7f96d096c9b2289d6e0.avif?t=1757300090\" width=600 height=100 /></span>Join the fight from wherever you are! Whether you\u2019re sharing a couch with future rivals or hopping into a match from across the world, <i>Shroom Siege</i> remains dynamic and tailored to each unique gaming setup.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring the entire community together with cross-play across Steam and Nintendo Switch platforms. It\u2019s always a good time for a siege, regardless of location, platform, or setup!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2383960/extras/a8b613e8f71aafd4dcdce1771f082d5c.avif?t=1757300090\" width=600 height=100 /></span>Taking cues from the arcade hit, Killer Queen, Shroom Siege introduces its unique gameplay mechanics. It's a game that's easy to pick up, yet offers depth and complexity for those who crave a strategic challenge. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2383960/extras/7a4f211634f7454a6ecd1eb61d2b366c.avif?t=1757300090\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Claim victory in one of three ways:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shrine Victory</strong>: Deliver spores to all shrines across the map and maintain control of every shrine to succeed!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shogun Victory</strong>: Possess a Shogun warrior and defeat the opponent\u2019s Shogun thrice!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Poop\u2026Victory?</strong>: Push a giant dung ball from one side of the map to the other to claim this satisfying victory!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An insect minion must be possessed and controlled by a shroom at all times, adding an additional layer of complexity to each battle. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2383960/extras/7f25a305322a6e817d5e3e2ad0181ee9.poster.avif?t=1757300090\" width=614 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2383960/extras/7f25a305322a6e817d5e3e2ad0181ee9.webm?t=1757300090\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2383960/extras/7f25a305322a6e817d5e3e2ad0181ee9.mp4?t=1757300090\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2383960/extras/0f412ac3387ac723f212b99d664b0ead.avif?t=1757300090\" width=600 height=100 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into fair and engaging battles with <i>Shroom Siege</i>\u2019s balanced matchmaking system, which pairs teams of similar skill levels. Both fresh and seasoned aspiring fungi can find matches challenging and fun for both parties.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2383960/extras/7fbebad1e59539883560e6dd78c3be10.avif?t=1757300090\" width=600 height=100 /></span>Designed with controllers in mind, <i>Shroom Siege</i> is playable via keyboard and mouse, as well as controllers of all types. Find the winning playstyle with a simple control scheme accessible for all players!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2383960/extras/f3dd96ed600445fa49b082189b535375.poster.avif?t=1757300090\" width=614 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2383960/extras/f3dd96ed600445fa49b082189b535375.webm?t=1757300090\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2383960/extras/f3dd96ed600445fa49b082189b535375.mp4?t=1757300090\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Shroom Siege offers a balanced blend of strategy, action, and fun. So, gather your friends or join the online community, and let's start the siege!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2383960?t=1757300090","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2383960/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757300090","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2383960/1269026a8844413de3a02f59db8b92cb85f24ca1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757300090","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2383960/1269026a8844413de3a02f59db8b92cb85f24ca1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757300090","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Remote Play on TV","id":43},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":2471870,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Just Updated</h1><p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae Shroom Siege Demo Now Supports Cross-Play! \ud83c\udf44\u2694\ufe0f</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Big news, warriors of the mushroom kingdom! \ud83c\udf1f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>Shroom Siege demo has officially launched on Xbox</strong> as part of the Xbox Indie Selects Demo Fest 2025, and we\u2019re thrilled to announce that it now features <strong>full cross-play support with the Steam demo</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That means whether you\u2019re playing on <strong>Xbox</strong> or <strong>PC (Steam)</strong>, you can now <strong>team up with your friends</strong> or <strong>battle against rivals</strong> across platforms in epic 4v4 matches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728 What\u2019s New:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd17 <strong>Cross-Play Multiplayer</strong> \u2013 Steam + Xbox players united</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Bigger Community</strong> \u2013 More warriors, more chaos, more fun</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude80 <strong>Jump in Now</strong> \u2013 The demo is live and waiting for you</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is just the beginning\u2014your feedback during this demo period will help us polish and balance the battlefield before the full launch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So grab your sword, rally your squad, and get ready to <strong>siege together, anywhere!</strong></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2383960/extras/0b3ff33ac521f265089d0ae2ca062bbc.poster.avif?t=1757300090\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2383960/extras/0b3ff33ac521f265089d0ae2ca062bbc.webm?t=1757300090\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2383960/extras/0b3ff33ac521f265089d0ae2ca062bbc.mp4?t=1757300090\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2383960/extras/c501dc399294dec78cd457e3cfe892df.avif?t=1757300090\" width=600 height=100 /></span>Manipulate a swarm of insect minions in fast-paced, team-based battles. Coordinate with fellow fungi to outwit opponents and fight for a taste of victory! Inspired by arcade hits like <i>Killer Queen</i>, <i>Shroom Siege</i> offers\u00a0 easy-to-learn gameplay mechanics and Japanese-inspired ink-wash designs, providing depth and complexity for seasoned shrooms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2383960/extras/f17d49f2d458e7f96d096c9b2289d6e0.avif?t=1757300090\" width=600 height=100 /></span>Join the fight from wherever you are! Whether you\u2019re sharing a couch with future rivals or hopping into a match from across the world, <i>Shroom Siege</i> remains dynamic and tailored to each unique gaming setup.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring the entire community together with cross-play across Steam and Nintendo Switch platforms. It\u2019s always a good time for a siege, regardless of location, platform, or setup!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2383960/extras/a8b613e8f71aafd4dcdce1771f082d5c.avif?t=1757300090\" width=600 height=100 /></span>Taking cues from the arcade hit, Killer Queen, Shroom Siege introduces its unique gameplay mechanics. It's a game that's easy to pick up, yet offers depth and complexity for those who crave a strategic challenge. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2383960/extras/7a4f211634f7454a6ecd1eb61d2b366c.avif?t=1757300090\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Claim victory in one of three ways:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shrine Victory</strong>: Deliver spores to all shrines across the map and maintain control of every shrine to succeed!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shogun Victory</strong>: Possess a Shogun warrior and defeat the opponent\u2019s Shogun thrice!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Poop\u2026Victory?</strong>: Push a giant dung ball from one side of the map to the other to claim this satisfying victory!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An insect minion must be possessed and controlled by a shroom at all times, adding an additional layer of complexity to each battle. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2383960/extras/7f25a305322a6e817d5e3e2ad0181ee9.poster.avif?t=1757300090\" width=614 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2383960/extras/7f25a305322a6e817d5e3e2ad0181ee9.webm?t=1757300090\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2383960/extras/7f25a305322a6e817d5e3e2ad0181ee9.mp4?t=1757300090\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2383960/extras/0f412ac3387ac723f212b99d664b0ead.avif?t=1757300090\" width=600 height=100 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into fair and engaging battles with <i>Shroom Siege</i>\u2019s balanced matchmaking system, which pairs teams of similar skill levels. Both fresh and seasoned aspiring fungi can find matches challenging and fun for both parties.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2383960/extras/7fbebad1e59539883560e6dd78c3be10.avif?t=1757300090\" width=600 height=100 /></span>Designed with controllers in mind, <i>Shroom Siege</i> is playable via keyboard and mouse, as well as controllers of all types. Find the winning playstyle with a simple control scheme accessible for all players!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2383960/extras/f3dd96ed600445fa49b082189b535375.poster.avif?t=1757300090\" width=614 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2383960/extras/f3dd96ed600445fa49b082189b535375.webm?t=1757300090\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2383960/extras/f3dd96ed600445fa49b082189b535375.mp4?t=1757300090\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Shroom Siege offers a balanced blend of strategy, action, and fun. So, gather your friends or join the online community, and let's start the siege!</p>","developers":["Upside Down Bird"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2383960/header.jpg?t=1757300090","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 12.04+, SteamOS+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> SSE2 instruction set support<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> OpenGL Core<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 800 MB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Mac OS X 10.9+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> SSE2 instruction set support<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Metal<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 800 MB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.